message: "If you use this software or its architectural concepts in your research, please cite it using these metadata."
type: software
title: "wasapi-router-go: Ultra-Low-Latency Windows Core Audio Loopback Mirroring Engine, Hermite Cubic ASRC, and Real-Time DSP Telemetry in Go"
abstract: "A zero-CGo, heap-safe Windows Audio Session API (WASAPI) real-time loopback routing matrix and DSP telemetry suite in Go featuring MMCSS Pro Audio kernel scheduling, lock-free SPSC ring buffers, 4-point Hermite cubic asynchronous sample rate conversion, automatic cross-device latency synchronization, and 16-band Hann-Goertzel spectral analysis."
